      "description": "Selected graph node with independent status, title, and hint; placement belongs to the graph layout.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-node ds-selected ds-checked\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-node-state\"><span class=\"ds-status-dot\"></span>条件已核对</span><span class=\"ds-node-title\">模型条件</span><span class=\"ds-node-hint\">点击查看来源</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-node{width:194px;min-height:94px;text-align:left;border:1px solid #cfd9e8;border-radius:11px;padding:13px 14px;background:var(--paper,#fff);color:var(--ink,#19283f);font-family:\"Segoe UI\",\"Microsoft YaHei UI\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .16s,box-shadow .16s}.ds-node:hover{border-color:#8b9fc4}.ds-node.ds-selected{border:2px solid var(--blue,#2945af);padding:12px 13px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px #2945af12}.ds-node-state{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted,#637187);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;margin-bottom:6px}.ds-checked .ds-node-state{color:var(--teal,#14675b)}.ds-status-dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor}.ds-node-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;display:block}.ds-node-hint{font-size:11px;display:block;color:var(--muted,#637187);margin-top:3px}.ds-node.ds-decision{background:#fffaf0;border-color:#d9bd88}.ds-decision .ds-node-state{color:var(--amber,#855616)}.ds-node:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #5275df;outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-node{transition:none;animation:none}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Research Workbench",
    "overview": "Cool white work surfaces, a pale blue navigation rail, and restrained state colors support reading source material and inspecting mathematical decisions. Concise Chinese labels and nearby actions keep the work approachable.\n\nThis record covers only the clickable prototype in `web/prototype.html`, `web/prototype.css`, and `web/prototype.js`. It does not define the legacy application's design system. Tokens describe the implemented artifact; the confirmed direction is recorded in `docs/prototype-direction.md`.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Quiet navigation and clearly ranked actions.",
      "White, bordered work surfaces with restrained depth.",
      "Source-linked content and inspectable reasoning nodes.",
      "Color states accompanied by readable labels."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Labeled State Rule",
        "body": "Pair status color with words; confirmation of input must not visually imply a checked proof.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Bordered Surface Rule",
        "body": "Use borders and tonal separation for ordinary work panels; reserve stronger depth for overlays and lifted document material.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do keep primary actions beside the work they advance.",
      "Do retain readable status labels alongside color.",
      "Do preserve visible keyboard focus and reduced-motion behavior.",
      "Do keep source references and decision consequences accessible."
